      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FERDINAND.\nNo, precious creature;\nI had rather crack my sinews, break my back,\nThan you should such dishonour undergo,\nWhile I sit lazy by.",
