    {
      "id": "the-tempest/sceneIII_32.1/p@75413",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FERDINAND.\nI am, in my condition,\nA prince, Miranda; I do think, a King;\nI would not so!—and would no more endure\nThis wooden slavery than to suffer\nThe flesh-fly blow my mouth. Hear my soul speak:\nThe very instant that I saw you, did\nMy heart fly to your service; there resides,\nTo make me slave to it; and for your sake\nAm I this patient log-man.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
