      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PROSPERO.\nSo glad of this as they, I cannot be,\nWho are surpris’d withal; but my rejoicing\nAt nothing can be more. I’ll to my book;\nFor yet, ere supper time, must I perform\nMuch business appertaining.",
